Let me check facts from allowed sources: the vision/requirements file to see A2, A5, R2, A1, L1, L2, and to verify wording. Also the spec. The brief says I may read only these paths: the round-1 question (and everything it lets me read) plus the four answers. So I can read the vision, spec, code_map/src, fixtures.json, COVERAGE.md, strengthen answers/compare.md. Let me read the vision and relevant parts of the spec. This is important because proposals 2, 8, 9 hinge on R2 and L1/L2 wording.

